Package: keenetic-entware-extras
Version: 0.5.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Description: Shared shell libraries and CLI tools for keenetic-entware-extras.
 Provides common.sh (logging, validation, router IP detection), lists.sh
 (list processing with @include support, deduplication), and ip.sh (CIDR
 aggregation, ISP interface detection, DNS resolver auto-detection).
 Installs the `kee-status` command (/opt/bin/kee-status) — an aggregated
 diagnostic that runs every sub-package status.sh and reports Alive/FAIL
 plus filtered error lines grouped by subsection.
 Base package for geo-split, smartdns-conf-ru-split, smartdns-redirect and others.
Section: lib
Priority: optional
